+
+No current password hashing algorithm decision is recorded for this project. The project's history contains two conflicting, unconfirmed mentions (bcrypt, then later argon2id), but neither is corroborated at a sufficient trust level to treat as the project's settled choice, so no algorithm is documented here as decided.
